        "cooked": "<p>The fabled 300th episode.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-300-writers-room-justice-comics-738\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-300-writers-room-justice-comics-738\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-300-writers-room-justice-comics-738\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #300 - Writers' Room: Justice Comics #738</a></h3>\n\n  <p>A long episode for our three-hundredth!  Show Notes: Run Time: 2:38:08 A big episode, indeed! We come in with a hint of a plan, tell a couple stories, and then go to the Letters section, where we tell even more stories! If you're on the , you can...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a0d75b87bfeae8d265f53b71a314e98a4c09ec4c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/a0d75b87bfeae8d265f53b71a314e98a4c09ec4c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a0d75b87bfeae8d265f53b71a314e98a4c09ec4c_2_323x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mWRNopCU58DkHt4DHXqDwdChPIw\" width=\"323\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a0d75b87bfeae8d265f53b71a314e98a4c09ec4c_2_323x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a0d75b87bfeae8d265f53b71a314e98a4c09ec4c_2_484x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a0d75b87bfeae8d265f53b71a314e98a4c09ec4c_2_646x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"865D45\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2970 596 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
